	(gr_text "RR-CHS-MAIN  Chassis main board   rev A   2026-11-26   RR-EL-0100\n\nFABRICATION NOTES\n1. Material FR-4, Tg >= 150 C, 6 copper layers, finished thickness 1.60 mm +/-10 %.\n2. Outer copper 35 um (1 oz) finished; inner copper 17.5 um (0.5 oz).\n3. Min track / space 0.15 / 0.15 mm.  Min finished hole 0.30 mm.  Min annular ring 0.13 mm.\n4. Surface finish ENIG.  Solder mask both sides, vias tented.  Silkscreen both sides.\n5. Board outline per layer Edge.Cuts, tolerance +/-0.1 mm.  Outline 160.00 x 100.00 mm.\n6. Drill / pick-and-place origin = board origin, marked + on this drawing (Y axis up).\n7. Electrical test 100 % against the supplied Gerber netlist data.\n\nSTACKUP (top to bottom, mm)\n   F.Cu 0.035 (signal)\n   prepreg 0.0994\n   In1.Cu 0.0152 (GND plane)\n   core FR-4 0.5708\n   In2.Cu 0.0152 (signal)\n   prepreg 0.1088\n   In3.Cu 0.0152 (signal)\n   core FR-4 0.5708\n   In4.Cu 0.0152 (power plane)\n   prepreg 0.0994\n   B.Cu 0.035 (signal)\n\nHOLE TABLE (finished sizes, mm)\n   dia      type   qty   use\n   0.3      PTH    930   \n   0.4      PTH    40    \n   0.5      PTH    48    \n   1.0      PTH    8     \n   1.02     PTH    20    \n   1.3      PTH    16    \n   1.8      PTH    18    \n   3.0      NPTH   9     \n   3.2      PTH    6     \n   (970 of the plated holes are vias)"
		(at 226 86 0)
